          "title": "You'll want to know: چھیلنا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چھیلنا — chhīlnā — \"to peel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "میں نے چھری سے آلو چھیلے۔ maiṅ ne chhurī se ālū chhīle. I peeled the potatoes with a knife."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے سیب چھیلا, us ne seb chhīlā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چھیلنا (chhīlnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin chīlnā, \"to peel\", under chilla, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 5051)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
